ve. 2.3 The engagement shall be purely on a contractual basis. 2.4 The engagement shall be initially for a period of one year including probation period of three weeks. The tenure of engagement may be extended on a year to year basis, depending on the performance evaluation. Af ter three years no further extension will be permissible under any circumstances. 3. Qualification, Experience and Vacancies : Applicants with the following qualifications and experience would be considered for engagement as Associate (Lega",
